@@ -57,6 +57,16 @@ make sandbox-check
 Runtime selection is automatic; on macOS Finch is preferred when available. Set
 `TYCHO_SANDBOX_RUNTIME=docker` or `finch` to select one explicitly.
 
+On a Linux host with Landlock ABI 6 or newer, an administrator may instead pin a
+qualified [Sandlock](https://github.com/multikernel/sandlock) binary and select it
+explicitly. Sandlock is never selected by `auto`:
+
+```bash
+export TYCHO_SANDBOX_RUNTIME=sandlock
+export TYCHO_SANDLOCK_BINARY=/opt/tycho/sandlock
+make sandbox-check
+```
